course: dictionary
lesson: 829
title: Below: place, number, and page
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Below is a small word with three jobs. It can show a place that is lower, a number that is less than another, or a part of a page that comes later. Look at the words around it to see which job it is doing.
explain: «The flat below ours» means the flat that is lower down in the same building. The clue is ours: the flat is under the one we live in. «Below zero» is about numbers, so it means less than zero. Ask yourself: is this about where something is, a number, or a page?
explain: «See the picture below» does not mean under anything. It means look further on in the text or page. The word see gives the clue. Put your meaning into the sentence, and if it still makes sense, you have it.
fact: Below means lower than something, or under it.
fact: Below can mean less than a number, as in «below 10» or «below zero».
fact: In writing, «see below» means look later on the page.
fact: «Thunderstorm clouds reach so high that their tops are far below freezing, even in summer.» Far below freezing means much colder than freezing point.
fact: «Chocolate melts just below body temperature», so it melts in your mouth but stays hard on a cool shelf.
exercise: «The flat below ours has a red door.» What does below mean here? | Next to our flat, on the same floor | Behind our flat | *Lower down, under our flat | Higher up than our flat
exercise: What does «below zero» mean on a thermometer? | Exactly zero | Warmer than zero | *Colder than zero, a number less than zero | Above the top of the scale
exercise: «See the picture below.» Where is the picture? | In the cupboard | At the start of the book | *Later on the page | Under the table
test: «Thunderstorm clouds are far below freezing, even in summer.» What does below freezing mean? | Frozen into ice cubes only | *Colder than freezing point | Warmer than freezing | Just a little cooler than the summer sun
test: Which phrase means less than 10? | *Below 10 | Above 10 | Next to 10 | Exactly 10
exam: In «blue above and yellow below», which colour is lower down? | Blue | Green | *Yellow | They are both at the same height
